  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-008 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, Sivir, Kled, Xayah, and Urgot. Version 0.10.1 fixes Urgot's battle baseline and face-focused HUD portraits, gives his basic attack a visible muzzle/projectile/impact chain, wires all twelve Purge shots to distinct muzzle and hit effects with a persistent cannon state, adds a readable Fear Beyond Death launch/chain/pull/execute presentation, and legality-gates AI use of R then W. It retains the 0.10.0 HD rebuilds for Shen, Lucian, Orianna, Briar, and Sivir, Xayah/Kled fixes, deterministic elemental drakes, and the existing Rift quality pack. Built for Teamfight Manager 2 v0.5.0 Mod API 0.8.",
